<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 66.20 to 6852.72.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.66 to 415.68.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.17.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1357 to 1107.</p>
<p>Volume was 536,219,500 compared with 432,630,900 on Monday.</p>
